#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:11
msgid ""
"生产系列入口是STM32F4。精确料号、器件视图、四个F407 "
"Board及模式分别说明；厂商SDK库存不参与默认支持。芯片存在、公开接口和配置通过不证明实板已运行。"
msgstr ""
"STM32F4 is the production family entry. Exact parts, device views, four F407"
" Boards and modes are described separately; vendor SDK inventory does not "
"establish default support. The presence of a chip, public interface or "
"accepted configuration does not prove physical execution."

