msgstr ""
"LQFP144, 1 MiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM and 64 KiB CCM; [internal-CRC "
"software references](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_family/README.md) use HSI16 "
"only and declare no physical PCB or external oscillator"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "STM32F411RET6"
msgstr "STM32F411RET6"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"LQFP64、512 KiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、无 CCM；显式 HSI96 RUN，并保留 direct HSI16；所选 "
"TIM2／CRC 与精确高频配置下 RTC／Power 参考分别校验，不扩展到其它外设模式"
msgstr ""
"LQFP64, 512 KiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM, no CCM; explicit HSI96 RUN with "
"direct HSI16 retained; the selected TIM2/CRC references and RTC/Power "
"references under exact high-frequency configurations are checked separately,"
" without extending support to other peripheral modes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "STM32F446ZET6"
msgstr "STM32F446ZET6"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"LQFP144、512 KiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、无 CCM；显式 HSI168 RUN，并保留 direct "
"HSI16；SAI1／2 消费独立 M 的 PLLSAI Q，不开放 LTDC R"
msgstr ""
"LQFP144, 512 KiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM, no CCM; explicit HSI168 RUN with "
"direct HSI16 retained; SAI1/2 consume PLLSAI Q with an independent M; LTDC R"
" is not enabled"

