msgstr "Bare metal"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "显式选择 `baremetal`；启动不创建调度器或产品任务，调用者推进 service 与停止"
msgstr ""
"Explicit `baremetal` selection; startup creates neither a scheduler nor "
"product tasks. The caller advances service and shutdown"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "FreeRTOS"
msgstr "FreeRTOS"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "静态任务／队列／等待适配；按所选 assembly、实际 IRQ syscall ceiling 和执行上下文接入"
msgstr ""
"Static task / queue / wait adapters; integration follows the selected "
"assembly, actual IRQ syscall ceiling and execution context"

