msgstr ""
"The maintained M4 adapter subset and explicit consumers; it does not inherit"
" every FreeRTOS mode combination"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "Native／CPU-only Runtime"
msgstr "Native／CPU-only Runtime"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "Native 是显式 host-test scope；CPU-only Runtime 不提供 SoC 外设，二者都不是 PCB 资格"
msgstr ""
"Native is an explicit host-test scope; CPU-only Runtime supplies no SoC "
"peripherals. Neither establishes PCB qualification"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:30
msgid ""
"引脚、AF、DMA、IRQ、Flash 几何和资源冲突只在 [SoC 事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/facts/soc.json)、"
" [路线](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/facts/routes.json)、[Board "
"包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/boards/README.md)及 实际 provider 中维护。本页不复制第二份 pin／DMA 表。软件 fixture "
"只声明测试路线； 原理图、元件实装、跳线、电压和晶振事实仍须由精确 Board 授权。"
msgstr ""
"Pins, AF, DMA, IRQ, Flash geometry and resource conflicts are maintained "
"only in the [SoC facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/facts/soc.json), "
"[routes](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/facts/routes.json), [Board "
"packages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/boards/README.md) and actual providers. This page does not duplicate "
"pin / DMA tables. Software fixtures declare test routes only; schematics, "
"fitted components, jumpers, voltage and oscillator facts still require exact"
" Board authorization."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:36
msgid ""
"OS 的静态对象、权限、IRQ 和退出要求见 [OS 合同](../contracts/os/execution.md)与 "
"[后端入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/README.md)。选择一个后端不自动验证每种外设／低功耗组合。"
msgstr ""
"Static OS objects, privilege, IRQ and exit requirements are defined by the "
"[OS contract](../contracts/os/execution.md) and [backend "
"entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/README.md). Selecting a backend does not automatically validate "
"every peripheral / low-power combination."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:39
msgid ""
"F405／F407 共用 DS8626 Rev12，F415／F417 共用 DS8597 Rev10；经典四款器件复用 67 "
"项共同控制器事实，ETH／DCMI 只由 F407／F417 选择，基础 CRYP／HASH 限定 F415／F417。F411、F446、F479 "
"分别绑定独立 RM／ES profile；F446 的 PLLSAI M 独立，F479 与主 PLL 共用 M，同一 System owner "
"管理所选 Q／R 输出。"
msgstr ""
"F405/F407 share DS8626 Rev12; F415/F417 share DS8597 Rev10. These four "
"classic devices reuse 67 common controller facts. Only F407/F417 select "
"ETH/DCMI; basic CRYP/HASH is restricted to F415/F417. F411, F446 and F479 "
"bind independent RM/ES profiles. F446 has independent PLLSAI M; F479 shares "
"M with the main PLL. One System owner manages the selected Q/R outputs."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:44
msgid ""
"精确 package、IRQ、DMA 和路线仍逐料号检查。F479NI 当前显式 GPIO 名单为 159 项， 与资料摘要 161 "
"项的差异保持未知，不补猜 pad。新料号与 IP 的软件参考不声明 PCB 接线；开发包 `publishable=false`、ARM 对象或单个 "
"ELF 不能代替最终 clean-source 候选及全部消费者。原四板范围不变，全部物理 HIL 保持未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Package, IRQ, DMA and routes are checked per exact part. F479NI currently "
"has 159 explicit GPIO names; the difference from the datasheet summary's 161"
" remains unknown rather than inventing pads. New-part/IP software references"
" make no PCB-wiring claims. A `publishable=false` development package, ARM "
"object or single ELF cannot replace the final clean-source candidate and "
"every consumer. The original four Board identities are unchanged; all "
"physical HIL remains unexecuted."

