#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "System／时钟"
msgstr "System / clocks"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F407 默认 `hse8-pll168`，其余已审 custom HSE／HSI、PLL、总线和 Flash latency 共用 "
"ClockPlanIR。F411 显式 HSI96；F446／F479 显式 HSI168，均保留 direct HSI16。F479 可选 "
"M10／N210 以同时使用共享 M 的 PLLSAI 音频／图形输出；System 先证明 PLLRDY／VOSRDY、prefetch 与 "
"latency，再切换并发布时间。HSI 名义频率不证明 USB 或音频精度。无 180 MHz／overdrive 或运行期 DVFS；新增器件 "
"STOP 只按独立已审高频 profile 与唤醒合同开放"
msgstr ""
"F407 defaults to `hse8-pll168`; other reviewed custom HSE/HSI, PLL, bus and "
"Flash-latency configurations share ClockPlanIR. F411 explicitly uses HSI96; "
"F446/F479 explicitly use HSI168; all retain direct HSI16. F479 can select "
"M10/N210 to use PLLSAI audio/graphics outputs with shared M simultaneously; "
"System establishes PLLRDY/VOSRDY, prefetch and latency before switching and "
"publishing time. The nominal HSI frequency does not establish USB or audio "
"accuracy. No 180 MHz/overdrive or runtime DVFS; STOP on added parts is "
"enabled only under separately reviewed high-frequency profiles and wakeup "
"contracts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[System 与时钟](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"[System and clocks](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "Sleep／STOP"
msgstr "Sleep／STOP"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"浅 Sleep 保留时间域；F407 既有配置与 F411／F446／F479 精确高频软件参考分别支持受约束 STOP。实际 traits 校验 "
"NVIC bank、备份／CCM 和唤醒源，拒绝外来低功耗／debug 状态；排空后进入 STOP，真实 System 恢复才建立新 Core "
"epoch，旧 deadline 不继承。仅 baremetal，elapsed bounds 由调用者提供"
msgstr ""
"Shallow Sleep preserves the time domain; existing F407 configurations and "
"exact high-frequency software references for F411/F446/F479 separately "
"support constrained STOP. Actual traits validate NVIC banks, backup/CCM and "
"wakeup sources, rejecting foreign low-power/debug states; STOP follows "
"drain, and only actual System restoration establishes a new Core epoch. Old "
"deadlines are not inherited. Baremetal only; callers supply elapsed bounds"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[System 低功耗](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md)、[ClockDomain "
"屏障](../contracts/platform/clock-domain.md)"
msgstr ""
"[System low power](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md), [ClockDomain "
"barrier](../contracts/platform/clock-domain.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "Standby"
msgstr "Standby"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"显式 WKUP／RTC 唤醒与同一 RTC owner 的准备收条；F446 另校验 EWUP2／PC13 与晶体 LSE 的冲突。F479 "
"SBF／sticky WUF 阻止 RTC 重入；显式 reset-prepare 只按授权清 SBF，之后产品必须复位，平台不自动复位或清 "
"RTC。真实进入经复位重建启动；虚假返回建立新 Core epoch，restore 失败保留责任"
msgstr ""
"Explicit WKUP/RTC wakeup and a preparation receipt from the same RTC owner; "
"F446 also checks the EWUP2/PC13 conflict with crystal LSE. F479 SBF/sticky "
"WUF prevent RTC re-entry; explicit reset-prepare clears SBF only as "
"authorized, after which the product must reset. The platform does not "
"automatically reset or clear RTC. Actual entry restarts through reset; a "
"spurious return establishes a new Core epoch, and restore failure retains "
"responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[System 低功耗](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md)、[RTC "
"合同](../contracts/io/f407-rtc.md)"
msgstr ""
"[System low power](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md), [RTC "
"contract](../contracts/io/f407-rtc.md)"

