#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"IWDG／WWDG 显式启用；可选 WWDG EWI、HSE CSS／NMI、复位原因、首次故障记录与 DWT "
"trace。无自动喂狗、任务重启或旧时间域降频续跑"
msgstr ""
"Explicit IWDG / WWDG activation; optional WWDG EWI, HSE CSS / NMI, reset "
"cause, first-fault record and DWT trace. No automatic feeding, task restart "
"or downclocked continuation in the old time domain"

