#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"SPI1／2／3 polling、8／16-bit 分段事务、有限 DMA；`irq-frames` 提供 "
"master／slave、单双线、Motorola／TI 与双线 CRC。F4 polling／recover 只在特权、未屏蔽 Thread "
"执行；preflight 拒绝不写 progress 或控制存储，精确原地收发与部分重叠分别处理。单线 CRC "
"拒绝；主接收精确帧数以声明时序预算成立为条件"
msgstr ""
"SPI1/2/3 polling, 8/16-bit segmented transactions and finite DMA; `irq-"
"frames` provides master/slave, single/dual-line, Motorola/TI and dual-line "
"CRC. F4 polling/recover executes only in privileged unmasked Thread context."
" Preflight rejection writes neither progress nor control storage; exact in-"
"place transfer and partial overlap are handled separately. Single-line CRC "
"rejects; exact master receive frame counts depend on the declared timing "
"budget."

