msgstr "I2C target/SMBus"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"I2C1／2／3 的 `target-irq` 提供 7／10-bit 自身地址与 7-bit 双地址；`smbus-device` 为 "
"7-bit、至多 100 kHz，可选 PEC／SMBA ARA。每方向至多 256 B、WRITE_READ 合计至多 512 "
"B、最多两个地址阶段；IRQ、无 DMA，响应预计算。PEC 受声明 IRQ 预算约束；ARP／Host Notify 与命令策略由产品提供"
msgstr ""
"I2C1/2/3 `target-irq` provides 7- or 10-bit own addresses and dual 7-bit "
"addressing; `smbus-device` uses 7-bit addresses at up to 100 kHz with "
"optional PEC/SMBA ARA. At most 256 B per direction, 512 B total for "
"WRITE_READ and two address phases; IRQ only, no DMA, with precomputed "
"responses. PEC depends on the declared IRQ budget; products provide ARP, "
"Host Notify and command policy"

