"位；TIM1／3／4／5／8 支持 x2／x4 正交计数。TIM2 保留给 Core，TIM6／7 用作专用触发；timer personality "
"独占，IRQ 只取得所选模式实际使用的向量"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed TIM3 / 4 / 5 / 9–14 PWM; TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 / 9–14 raw input "
"capture, with 1 / 2 / 4 channels according to the instance and a full 32-bit"
" count on TIM5. TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 support x2 / x4 quadrature counting. "
"TIM2 is reserved for Core and TIM6 / 7 for dedicated triggers. Timer "
"personalities are exclusive; an IRQ lease covers only the vector actually "
"used by the selected mode"

