#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "多 ADC／注入采集"
msgstr "Multiple ADCs / injected acquisition"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"`adc_group` 独占 ADC123 域；保留有限 regular／injected 与双／三 ADC 同步或交错，新增对应 regular "
"DBM blocks。同一同步 owner 可接一次软件或独占 Table69 timer 注入；有限 `regular-auto-injected` "
"用具名 descriptor 联合借用 regular／injected 两个 span，TC＋全部 JEOC＋真实 join 才共同终止。交错 "
"blocks 按原生 CDR 几何、最快吞吐和 service gap 准入，不承诺均匀 aperture。未建立连续 JAUTO 逐次 "
"JDR、交错＋注入或未知外来 trigger 合同。"
msgstr ""
"`adc_group` exclusively owns ADC123. Finite regular/injected and dual/triple"
" simultaneous or interleaved acquisition remain, with corresponding regular "
"DBM blocks added. One simultaneous owner can accept a software or exclusive "
"Table69 timer injection. Finite `regular-auto-injected` jointly borrows two "
"regular/injected spans through a named descriptor and terminates them "
"together only after TC, all JEOC and actual join. Interleaved blocks use "
"native CDR geometry, fastest throughput and service-gap admission without "
"promising uniform aperture. Per-conversion JDR guarantees for continuous "
"JAUTO, interleaved+injected operation and unknown external triggers have no "
"current contract."

