msgstr "[Multi-ADC contract](../contracts/io/f407-adc-groups.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "DAC"
msgstr "DAC"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"单／双通道 direct、独占 timer、noise／triangle、有限／循环 DMA 与 idle code；可选 EXTI9 event-"
"only 外部触发 CPU／循环 DMA，实际外部 rate 为 unknown，有限外部尾部拒绝。ES0182 恢复可内部转换声明的 "
"idle，随后短时禁输出，不计 payload，不保证请求间模拟连续。"
msgstr ""
"Single/dual-channel direct, exclusive timer, noise/triangle, finite/circular"
" DMA and idle code. Optional EXTI9 event-only external triggering covers "
"CPU/circular DMA; actual external rate remains unknown and finite external "
"tails are rejected. ES0182 recovery may internally convert the declared idle"
" code, then briefly disable outputs. These conversions are not payload "
"progress and do not guarantee uninterrupted analog output between requests."

