#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "DCMI"
msgstr "DCMI"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"RAW／JPEG snapshot、连续 RAW storage blocks，及有限 frames-raw／frames-jpeg CM1 "
"会话。每帧完整 join 后发布并重启，允许间隙和缺 FREE 时 source-off 等待；会话 transferred 统计完整帧前缀。JPEG "
"word padding 不等于码流长度，无 CM0 无缝完整帧。VE 最高 12-bit，ZG 可选 14-bit。"
msgstr ""
"RAW/JPEG snapshots, continuous RAW storage blocks and finite frames-"
"raw/frames-jpeg CM1 sessions. Every frame fully joins before publication and"
" restart, with gaps and source-off waiting without a FREE slot. Session "
"transferred counts the complete-frame prefix. JPEG word padding does not "
"identify codestream length; no gapless CM0 complete frames. VE supports up "
"to 12 bits; ZG may select 14 bits."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[DCMI／音频合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"[DCMI/audio contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "I2S2／3"
msgstr "I2S2／3"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"master／slave × TX／RX／duplex 的有限 DMA 与连续 `*-blocks`；Philips、MSB／LSB "
"justified、PCM short／long，16／24／32-bit 数据。master 显式 PLLI2S，slave 实际外部 rate 为 "
"unknown；连续模式显式声明 rate／service 上界，使用调用者 block 存储，已发布 RX loan 单独归还。不转换音频格式"
msgstr ""
"Finite DMA and continuous `*-blocks` for master/slave × TX/RX/duplex; "
"Philips, MSB/LSB justified, PCM short/long and 16/24/32-bit data. Masters "
"explicitly select PLLI2S; the actual external slave rate is unknown. "
"Continuous modes declare explicit rate/service upper bounds and use caller-"
"owned block storage; published RX loans are returned separately. Audio "
"formats are never converted."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[音频合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md)、[有限 slave TX "
"路径](../contracts/io/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md)"
msgstr ""
"[Audio contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md), [Finite "
"slave TX path](../contracts/io/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "SAI1／SAI2"
msgstr "SAI1/SAI2"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F446 的 SAI1／2、F479 的 SAI1：A／B master／slave × TX／RX／同步 duplex，有限与连续 "
"`*-blocks`，8／10／16／20／24／32 有效位、至多 16 wire slots。显式 active mask 只为有效 slot 分配"
" FIFO 容器，保留原 wire 位置，不做重排。连续模式使用 caller block 存储、声明 SCK／service 上界，撤回目标后才发布 "
"RX loan；缺块撤源、失败排空保留责任。master 消费唯一 System PLLSAI Q；slave 实际外部速率 unknown。无跨 "
"SAI 同步、AC97／SPDIF 或物理时序保证"
msgstr ""
"F446 SAI1/2 and F479 SAI1: A/B master/slave × TX/RX/synchronized duplex, "
"finite and continuous `*-blocks`, 8/10/16/20/24/32 useful bits and at most "
"16 wire slots. The explicit active mask allocates FIFO containers only for "
"enabled slots, preserving wire positions without reordering. Continuous "
"modes use caller block storage and declared SCK/service bounds; RX loans are"
" published only after target withdrawal. Missing blocks withdraw the source;"
" failed drain retains responsibility. Master consumes the sole System PLLSAI"
" Q; actual external slave rates remain unknown. No cross-SAI "
"synchronization, AC97/SPDIF or physical timing guarantee is supplied."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"[SAI 与布局](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"[SAI and layout](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/av/README.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "RTC／备份域"
msgstr "RTC / backup domain"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"`adopt-retained`／`provision-empty`、Alarm A request、Alarm "
"B、wakeup、timestamp、tamper、校准、20 个 backup registers、4 KiB backup SRAM CPU "
"lease 与显式 handoff。PC13 timestamp／tamper 需要 Board 明确授权 LSE bypass；四个现有 Board "
"的晶体配置不能据 API 存在推定支持。新增 F411／F446／F479 的晶体 LSE primary retained／provision "
"精确高频参考；F411 有 20 个 backup registers、无 backup SRAM，其 SRAM ops 为 "
"NULL；F446／F479 保留 4 KiB lease。未增加这些料号的 bypass、periodic 或 RTOS "
"组合。不提供世纪／时区或保持性证明"
msgstr ""
"`adopt-retained`/`provision-empty`, Alarm A request, Alarm B, wakeup, "
"timestamp, tamper, calibration, 20 backup registers, a 4 KiB backup SRAM CPU"
" lease and explicit handoff. PC13 timestamp/tamper requires explicit Board "
"authorization for LSE bypass; the API's existence does not establish support"
" under the four existing Boards' crystal configurations. Added exact high-"
"frequency references for F411/F446/F479 use crystal LSE primary "
"retained/provision; F411 has 20 backup registers and no backup SRAM, with "
"NULL SRAM ops; F446/F479 retain the 4 KiB lease. No bypass, periodic or RTOS"
" combinations are added for these parts. No century/timezone support or "
"proof of retention"

