msgstr "[RTC contract](../contracts/io/f407-rtc.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "内部 Flash／制造维护"
msgstr "Internal Flash / manufacturing maintenance"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F407 VE／ZG 的精确 sector 几何及显式 OTP／option／RDP 维护；F479NI 的 2 MiB／24 sectors 只提供 "
"poll-word 读写擦，bank2 逻辑编号映射 SNB16–27，拒绝交换映射、BFB2／PCROP 和未审 OPTCR1 维护。F479 按 "
"ES0321 在 pulse 前关闭 DCEN，真实 idle 后 reset／restore；失败保留同一 owner。Flash pulse "
"不可中止，同 bank 执行可停顿；deadline 不撤销借用。不自动回滚、重放不可逆维护或以软件 reset 代替 POR"
msgstr ""
"Exact F407 VE/ZG sector geometry and explicit OTP/option/RDP maintenance; "
"F479NI 2 MiB/24 sectors provides only poll-word read/program/erase. Bank-two"
" logical sectors map to SNB16–27; swapped mapping, BFB2/PCROP and unreviewed"
" OPTCR1 maintenance reject. F479 follows ES0321 by disabling DCEN before "
"pulses and resetting/restoring cache after actual idle; failures retain the "
"same owner. Flash pulses cannot be aborted and same-bank execution can "
"stall; deadlines do not revoke borrows. No automatic rollback, irreversible-"
"maintenance replay or software-reset substitute for POR is supplied."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "[物理存储与维护](../contracts/io/f4-flash-storage.md)"
msgstr ""
"[Physical storage and maintenance](../contracts/io/f4-flash-storage.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "SDIO／MMC／I/O functions"
msgstr "SDIO／MMC／I/O functions"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"SD memory／MMC polling、有限 IRQ／DMA；SDIO functions 使用独立 face 的 "
"CMD5／52／53。单卡、3.3 V，SD／SDIO 为 1／4 位，MMC 可显式选择经版本和 SWITCH 检查的 8 "
"位十引脚软件参考。memory 单块 CMD17／24，多块以一次 CMD18／25、CMD12 和 CMD13 READY 结束；combo "
"不同时维护 memory portion。默认速度使用精确 PLL48 与经 RM／勘误联合验证的分频；另选精确 F407 "
"`hse8-pll150-sdio375`、裸机四位 SD／MMC 37.5 MHz 高速 SDR，须完成 SD CMD6 或 MMC HS52 "
"协商。该 profile 不授予 USB／RNG 或低功耗；不提供其他高速组合、DDR／HS200"
msgstr ""
"SD memory/MMC polling and finite IRQ/DMA; SDIO functions use CMD5/52/53 "
"through a distinct face. One card at 3.3 V; SD/SDIO uses one/four bits, and "
"MMC may explicitly select the eight-bit, ten-pin software reference after "
"version and SWITCH checks. Memory single-block operations use CMD17/24; "
"multiblock operations finish one CMD18/25 with CMD12 and CMD13 READY. Combo "
"operation does not simultaneously maintain the memory portion. Default speed"
" uses exact PLL48 and divider constraints checked against the reference "
"manual and errata. The optional exact F407 `hse8-pll150-sdio375` profile "
"supports baremetal four-bit SD/MMC 37.5 MHz high-speed SDR after SD CMD6 or "
"MMC HS52 negotiation. This profile grants no USB/RNG or low-power modes; no "
"other high-speed combination, DDR or HS200 is provided"

