msgstr "FSMC"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"运行期 CPU window、永久 startup SRAM、parallel16，以及显式 PSRAM、有限 NOR "
"program／erase、raw NAND／OOB／ECC 码；bank 与 mux／burst／WAIT 按封装和所选模式授权，无 FTL "
"或自动纠错"
msgstr ""
"Runtime CPU windows, permanent startup SRAM, parallel16, explicit PSRAM, "
"finite NOR program / erase and raw NAND / OOB / ECC codes. Banks and mux / "
"burst / WAIT require package and selected-mode authorization; no FTL or "
"automatic error correction"

