"boundaries](../contracts/io/f4-flash-storage.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "FMC SDRAM"
msgstr "FMC SDRAM"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F479NI Bank1、8 MiB、16-bit、row12／column8；默认 CPU 数据窗口不授予 DMA。显式 `graphics-"
"owned` 通过 `memory_window` 引用，仅给所选 LTDC 只读、DMA2D 读写区域，共同保留原始 bank lease "
"直至冷退出。两种模式均检查七组时序、上电／刷新／自刷新等待与原 System epoch；WFDIS 共享约束在取得 gate 后实际观察。不授予启动 "
"RAM、XIP、自动 MPU 或实装 RAM 时序资格"
msgstr ""
"F479NI Bank1, 8 MiB, 16-bit, row12/column8. The default CPU data window "
"grants no DMA access. Explicit `graphics-owned` connections through "
"`memory_window` references grant readonly regions only to the selected LTDC "
"and read/write regions to DMA2D, jointly retaining the original bank lease "
"until cold exit. Both modes check seven timing groups, power-"
"up/refresh/self-refresh waits and the original System epoch; the shared "
"WFDIS constraint is actually observed after acquiring the gate. Neither "
"startup RAM, XIP, automatic MPU setup nor qualification of installed RAM "
"timing is granted"

