#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "QuadSPI／串行 NOR"
msgstr "QuadSPI/serial NOR"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F479NI＋W25Q128JV Flash1、24-bit SDR 1-1-1；PIO 读／program／4 KiB erase。可选 `qspi-"
"indirect-dma` 仅把 page-program 的 payload 交给 DMA2 Stream7 "
"Channel3，读／status／verify 保持 PIO；PIO 不分配 DMA 可变扩展。memory TC、QSPI idle、NOR WIP"
" 与 SETTLED 分别证明；取消和失败排空保留贷款。公共 async stop 保留 PREPARED，Platform cold stop "
"才归还硬件。可选 W25Q128JVSIQ 六 pad、6Bh／8 dummy 的 1-1-4 quad read，与 program DMA "
"独立；接管须 QE=1、SUS=0，不写状态或恢复外来 suspend。间接 Flash 端点整个生命周期禁止访问 0x90000000 "
"aperture。另选 `mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` 仅与 PIO 控制器组合，静态分配 1..8 reader "
"slots，只授权 live CPU loan 范围；无 Flash 旁路 face、DMA reader 或 "
"XIP。最后释放失败只保留清理，不能继续读取；不提供 DDR／dual 或自动保护修改"
msgstr ""
"F479NI + W25Q128JV Flash1, 24-bit SDR 1-1-1; PIO read/program/4 KiB erase. "
"Optional `qspi-indirect-dma` transfers only page-program payload through "
"DMA2 Stream7 Channel3, while read/status/verify remain PIO; PIO allocates no"
" mutable DMA extension. Memory-transfer TC, QSPI idle, NOR WIP and SETTLED "
"each require separate proof; cancellation and failed drain retain loans. "
"Public async stop retains PREPARED; only Platform cold stop returns hardware"
" resources. Optional W25Q128JVSIQ uses six pads and 6Bh/eight dummy clocks "
"for 1-1-4 quad read, independently of program DMA; adoption requires QE=1 "
"and SUS=0, without status writes or resuming a foreign suspend. Indirect "
"Flash endpoints forbid access to the 0x90000000 aperture throughout their "
"lifetime. Optional `mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` combines only with the "
"PIO controller, statically allocates 1..8 reader slots and authorizes only a"
" live CPU loan range; it exposes no bypass Flash face, DMA reader or XIP. "
"Failed final release retains cleanup responsibility only and permits no "
"further reads; DDR/dual and automatic protection changes are not provided"

