msgid "[间接 QuadSPI](../contracts/io/f479-qspi.md)"
msgstr "[Indirect QuadSPI](../contracts/io/f479-qspi.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "LTDC／DMA2D"
msgstr "LTDC/DMA2D"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F479NI 原生并行 RGB565／RGB888；RGB565／ARGB8888 内存，一／二 layer、2 active＋1 全局 "
"pending。IRQ 在真实 blanking 锁存同代退休证明，task join 后才归还旧 frame；visible 不等于 "
"SETTLED。独立 DMA2D 提供 fill／copy／convert／blend；所选 SDRAM 需显式 `graphics-owned` "
"连接并持有同一 bank lease。无 DSI、CLUT、隐藏 frame buffers 或对 FMC CPU-only 窗口的 DMA 授权"
msgstr ""
"F479NI native parallel RGB565/RGB888; RGB565/ARGB8888 memory, one/two "
"layers, 2 active plus 1 global pending frame. IRQ latches same-generation "
"retirement proof at actual blanking; task join precedes returning an old "
"frame. Visible is not SETTLED. Independent DMA2D provides "
"fill/copy/convert/blend. Selected SDRAM requires an explicit `graphics-"
"owned` connection and the same retained bank lease. No DSI, CLUT, hidden "
"frame buffers or DMA authorization for the FMC CPU-only window"

