#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "基础 CRYP／HASH"
msgstr "Basic CRYP/HASH"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F415／F417 的有限 IRQ 或独立可选 DMA blocks：AES ECB／CBC／CTR、DES／TDES "
"ECB／CBC，SHA1／MD5／HMAC。DMA 使用精确双流 CRYP／三阶段 HMAC，memory TC 不等于 engine／digest "
"完成；源与地址撤回、key／IV／context 清理后才结清。HASH DMA 输入／key 限正长度整 word，digest 仍按字节；普通 "
"hash 无 key。caller key 不擦除，无 worker／堆；不提供 DMA 空消息、字节尾部、原地 cipher overlap、AEAD"
" 或 F479 增强 IP 资格"
msgstr ""
"F415/F417 finite IRQ or independently optional DMA blocks: AES ECB/CBC/CTR, "
"DES/TDES ECB/CBC, SHA1/MD5/HMAC. DMA uses exact dual-stream CRYP/three-stage"
" HMAC; memory TC does not mean engine/digest completion. Settlement follows "
"source and address withdrawal and key/IV/context cleanup. HASH DMA input/key"
" are limited to positive lengths of whole words, while digests remain byte-"
"aligned; ordinary hash has no key. Caller keys are not erased; no "
"workers/heap, DMA empty messages, byte tails, in-place cipher overlap, AEAD "
"or qualification for F479 enhanced IP"

