#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"VE／ZG MII 与 ZG RMII、独立 MDIO；raw `eth` 与增强 `eth_frames` 分选。已选 HCLK 为 25–168 "
"MHz，MDC 与 PTP 20／40／80 ns 增量由计划推导。增强 face 提供整帧 SG、单 C-tag VLAN、显式 checksum "
"offload 和 MAC 硬件事件／PTP 时间戳；这不建立同步或物理精度资格，PHY 接线、协议栈、同步与网络政策由外部提供"
msgstr ""
"VE/ZG MII and ZG RMII with independent MDIO; raw `eth` and enhanced "
"`eth_frames` are selected separately. Selected HCLK is 25–168 MHz; MDC "
"division and the 20/40/80 ns PTP increment derive from the plan. The "
"enhanced face provides whole-frame SG, one VLAN C-tag, explicit checksum "
"offload and MAC hardware-event/PTP timestamps. This establishes no "
"synchronization or physical-accuracy qualification. PHY wiring, protocol "
"stacks, synchronization and network policy are external."

