#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"FS／HS 引擎的 Device／Host、PIO 与 HS AHB DMA；Device 支持 control、bulk、interrupt 和单 "
"transaction ISO packet。Device ISO 使用实际速度的帧窗口，接纳时剩余期限至多 1 秒，并满足受审 FIFO 分区；无 "
"ACK／自动重试或周期调度。内部 PHY 仍为 FS，外部 ULPI 提供 HS／FS 回退；显式 managed roles 与按需 ST 官方 "
"Core 桥接；Host 可用 caller 存储显式绑定周期机会和保守带宽预算，early BUSY 不暴露旧 DONE，无自动派发。同 epoch "
"提前零长 STATUS OUT 与 DATA IN 可并存，线上闭合后仍须双方向内存 join。不维护高带宽 ISO、自动 HNP／SRP 或 Host"
" split。"
msgstr ""
"FS/HS Device/Host engines, PIO and HS AHB DMA. Device supports control, "
"bulk, interrupt and single-transaction ISO packets. Device ISO uses actual-"
"speed frame windows, accepts at most one second of remaining deadline and "
"requires reviewed FIFO partitioning; there is no ACK, automatic retry or "
"periodic scheduler. Internal PHY remains FS; external ULPI provides HS/FS "
"fallback. Explicit managed roles and optional ST official Core bridges are "
"available. Host can explicitly bind periodic opportunities and conservative "
"bandwidth budgets using caller storage; early BUSY exposes no old DONE and "
"dispatch is not automatic. Same-epoch early zero-length STATUS OUT may "
"coexist with DATA IN; both memory directions must join after wire closure. "
"High-bandwidth ISO, automatic HNP/SRP and Host split remain unmaintained."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "[USB 所有权](../contracts/io/usb-lifecycle.md)"
msgstr "[USB ownership](../contracts/io/usb-lifecycle.md)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid "USB Device 远程唤醒"
msgstr "USB Device remote wake"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/support.md:0
msgid ""
"F407 的固定 Device 与 managed Device 阶段按需选择；FS、HS 内部 FS、ULPI 均由所选控制器的唯一 DCD "
"负责。host SET／CLEAR_FEATURE 在 STATUS IN 真实 ACK 后生效，取消或超时不撤销线上已提交作用。新 suspend "
"收条至少 5001 µs；有限 request 显式声明 service 延迟 B，满足 Core 时间／B 合同才证明 1–15 ms "
"信号。cancel／stop、拒撤或角色切换保留原 request／clock／pins，外部 USB 域失电或 CPU 停机不由该合同保证。共享 "
"Flash 开销按实际链接另测"
msgstr ""
"Selected as needed on F407 fixed Device or managed Device phases. FS, HS "
"internal-FS and ULPI configurations each retain their selected controller's "
"one DCD. Host SET/CLEAR_FEATURE takes effect only on the actual STATUS IN "
"ACK; cancellation or timeout cannot undo the committed wire effect. A fresh "
"suspend receipt must be at least 5001us old. The finite request declares "
"service-delay bound B; satisfying Core time/B contracts proves a 1–15 ms "
"signal. Cancel/stop, refused withdrawal and role changes retain the original"
" request/clocks/pins. The contract does not cover external USB-domain power "
"loss or CPU halt. Shared Flash costs require separate actual linked "
"measurements."

